{"overview":"سریال «روزی روزگاری» داستان راهزنی به نام «مرادبیگ» است. او با گروه راهزنی دیگر درگیر و زخمی می‌شود. خانواده‌ای روستایی او را نجات می‌دهند و زندگی در کنار آنها باعث می‌شود تا تغییر و تحولاتی در وجودش صورت گیرد. به این ترتیب، در طول داستان او از فردی راهزن به فردی صالح تبدیل می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"A popular bandit, Morad, is robbing trade caravans. During a fight with another bandit, he has been rescued from death by the rural family. He takes a profound challenge in his life with these villagers.","tagline_en":"","runtime":50,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":17,"y":1991,"poster":""}],"episodes":17,"crew":["Amrollah Ahmadjoo"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["IR"],"cast":[{"name":"خسرو شکیبایی","role":"Morad","photo":"/j7Mn0dBgmARuKMC9ajrp9FAE28g.jpg","en":"Khosro Shakibai"},{"name":"Mohammad Feyli","role":"Nasim/Basim","photo":"/6Dfh59auYMA4IdT5j1m7O6OIgpp.jpg"},{"name":"محمود پاک‌نیت","role":"Hesam","photo":"/rK6fa7MYfnEqql0oLartjGe966I.jpg","en":"Mahmoud Pakniat"},{"name":"Sadreddin Hejazi","role":"makhour","photo":"/qeekzLKbySxySMeve9jVruFIJFW.jpg"},{"name":"ژاله علو","role":"khale Leila","photo":"/kRlw5FjLnWyT60qA8IlS4xYuCZ2.jpg","en":"Zhale Olov"},{"name":"Shohre Soltani","role":"Masoomeh","photo":"/wAcGZUkQgBNgiUtyUBjOPIREJYg.jpg"},{"name":"پرویز پورحسینی","role":"Ghodrat","photo":"/31E3bbeXgzSB3yk7OmvnZrzzMK0.jpg","en":"Parviz Pourhosseini"},{"name":"Parviz Shahinkhou","role":"Kal Hossein","photo":"/mWc0XqrqZ9vFScP5yptiIhrXo2e.jpg"},{"name":"Mahmoud Jafari","role":"Shaban","photo":"/v1TCkGBYJvmefYzmjEHC6nECCrC.jpg"},{"name":"Hossein Khanibeik","role":"Ramezan-Ali","photo":"/6NZTsnnAmbENsfq5D8jbZsAmubV.jpg"},{"name":"Manouchehr Hamedi","role":"The Merchant","photo":""},{"name":"Jamshid Layegh","role":"Gholi Khan","photo":""}],"trailer":"","watch":{},"recs":[],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/101593"}